  "prefLabel": "En 910.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 910.01 Applicability. En 910 shall be applicable only to LMI community solar projects serving electric customers who have enrolled in, or are on the waitlist for, the electric assistance program and meet the requirements for EAP LMI community solar projects as defined in En 902.09.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
